WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.341
- Welcome to the Kelly
Clarkson Show everybody.

00:00:03.341 --> 00:00:04.651
(crowd cheering)

00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:06.660
We've got a special hour ahead for you.

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.300
These past couple weeks
we've been celebrating

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.100
all the joy and merriment of the season.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.530
You don't get to say
merriment a lot, you know?

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:14.670
We do here.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:16.410
We've got lots of cool guests for everyone

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.450
from former First Lady Michelle Obama

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.806
to Dolly Parton, to Amy Poehler.

00:00:20.806 --> 00:00:22.165
(crowd cheering)

00:00:22.165 --> 00:00:25.020
Everyone has had so much
holiday goodness to share.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.610
We just haven't had enough airtime

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.770
for all of it 'cause I'm chatty.

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.000
But that doesn't seem right.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.640
So today we've got a festive gift for you.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.518
This is a Kelly extra
helping of Christmas.

00:00:35.518 --> 00:00:39.270
(crowd cheering)
(Christmas music)

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.430
And it wouldn't be the Kelly Clarkson show

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:42.870
if we didn't start with music.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:45.030
So let's begin with the Kellyoke encore.

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:47.640
This is me and my band
y'all with Last Christmas.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.350
It's a bonus song from last year's

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.330
Holiday Spectacular
Kelly Clarkson presents

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.178
when Christmas comes around.

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:55.597
